From 4982c3d4c8a173ebef10b3981c632e39f9258c2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <trantoanvan@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:45:23 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(issues): child issues by status and days in status

The sub-issue panel shows a bar of the children by status next to the done
count, and each open child shows how many days it has sat in its status (from
one day, red from five). Reference: Jira's Child issues panel.

Patch-Id: child-panel
